      "title": "L.A. Confidential movie review - Roger Ebert",
      "snippet": "Confidential was a key magazine of the 1950s, a monthly that sold millions of copies with its seamy exposes of celebrity drugs and sex. I found it on my dad's night table and read it breathlessly, the stories of reefer parties, multiple divorces, wife-swapping and \"leading men\" who liked to wear frilly undergarments.",
